=== 9.2  the failure F10 describes, end to end ===
  a sweep that CRASHED 1 day ago -> skip=recent-sweep  lastRunId=wf_crashed
  so the next 14 days of scheduled ticks are skipped on the evidence of a run
  that produced nothing. Recovery is manual: 'Run now' (trigger!=='scheduled' is ungated).

